          "url": "https://deepchem.readthedocs.io/en/stable/api_reference/moleculenet.html",
          "accessed": "2026-11-08"
        }
      ]
    },
    "difficulty": {
      "value": "按任务难点而非题目难度标签区分：低样本、类别高度不平衡、量子性质及蛋白-配体关系；原论文没有一个可通用于全部数据集的难度总分。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/1703.00564",
          "accessed": "2026-11-08"
        }
      ]
    },
    "public_hidden_split": {
      "value": "原论文按训练/验证/测试 80/10/10 划分，并为不同任务采用随机、骨架或时间等划分；不是统一隐藏测试集。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/1703.00564",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "evaluation": {
    "metrics": {
      "value": "分类按任务使用 ROC-AUC 或 PRC-AUC；回归按任务使用误差指标，例如 PDBbind 的 RMSE。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/1703.00564",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scoring": {
      "value": "按子数据集和指定划分分别比较预测性能；不同划分与指标不得合并成一个统一总分。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/1703.00564",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "prompt_settings": {
      "value": "原始协议为监督训练/验证/测试，不适用zero-shot/few-shot提示模板；须固定featurizer、splitter、seed和数据版本。官方benchmark.py默认seed=123，且test默认False，需要-t才评test。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/deepchem/deepchem/blob/master/examples/benchmark.py",
          "accessed": "2026-11-08"
